  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing Water-induced Community-level Conflicts: Strengthening Water Systems, Community Adaptation and Resilience Bui</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prevention and reduction of community-level water-related stress, tensions and conflict for HDP nexus.&#xc774;&#xd574;&#xad00;&#xacc4;&#xc790;&#xb4e4;&#xc774; &#xc218;&#xc790;&#xc6d0; &#xad00;&#xb828; &#xc548;&#xbcf4; &#xc704;&#xd5d8;&#xacfc; &#xbd84;&#xc7c1;&#xc5d0; &#xc601;&#xd5a5;&#xc744; &#xbc1b;&#xb294; &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed;&#xc0ac;&#xd68c;&#xc758; &#xd544;&#xc694;&#xb97c; &#xc778;&#xc2dd;&#xd558;&#xace0; &#xc774;&#xd574;&#xd560; &#xc218; &#xc788;&#xb3c4;&#xb85d; &#xc9c0;&#xc6d0;&#xd558;&#xace0; &#xc774;&#xd574;&#xad00;&#xacc4;&#xc790;&#xb4e4;&#xc758; &#xc218;&#xc790;&#xc6d0; &#xad00;&#xb828; &#xbd84;&#xc7c1;&#xc758; &#xc870;&#xae30;&#xac1c;&#xc785;&#xacfc; &#xd574;&#xacb0;&#xc744; &#xac15;&#xd654;&#xd558;&#xae30; &#xc704;&#xd55c; &#xc801;&#xc751; &#xbc0f; &#xbcf5;&#xc6d0;&#xb825; &#xac15;&#xd654;&#xd558;&#xba70; &#xc218;&#xc790;&#xc6d0; &#xbc0f; &#xc2dc;&#xc124;&#xc5d0; &#xb300;&#xd55c; &#xc811;&#xadfc;&#xc744; &#xcd09;&#xc9c4;&#xd558;&#xace0;, &#xbb3c; &#xad00;&#xb828; &#xbd84;&#xc7c1;&#xc758; &#xc6d0;&#xc778;&#xacfc; &#xc720;&#xbc1c; &#xc694;&#xc778;&#xc744; &#xd574;&#xacb0;&#xc5d0; &#xae30;&#xc5ec;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tools and analyses will be developed to enhance relevant stakeholders awareness and understanding of water related security risks and the needs of conflict affected communities. This will involve detailed assessments of causes of conflicts within the community, the water governance dynamics, and the state of the water system,  including the disparities between demand and supply for water resources. Relevant community and institutional stakeholders will be equipped with adaptation and resilience capabilities to strengthen early intervention and resolution of water related conflicts. In order to address triggers of water related conflicts, access to water resources and water facilities will be improved.</narrative>
  </description>
